      "principle": "A respondent seeking custody of a child cannot do so in the guise of visitation rights.",
      "held": "Although the respondent, being a father and a natural guardian, is entitled to have the visitation right, he cannot seek for custody of the child as he has to approach the appropriate forum seeking such reliefs.",
